WHY THIS AND NOT A PERMISSIVE LICENSE. Citoya is a real, operable service
that handles the personal data of MINORS: names, dates of birth, guardian email
addresses, and verified service hours. An unmodified deployment of this code by
a third party would collect that data from real children under someone else's
control, with no guardian-consent process that this project's author can stand
behind. Permissive reuse is therefore withheld on purpose, not by omission.

